  "description": "Pumpkin Patch is a cute and bold bubble font with a playful, rounded style inspired by cozy pumpkin season and autumn crafts. Its chunky letterforms are easy to read and perfect for adding a fun seasonal touch to your creative projects.\nThis adorable Fall font is ideal for Cricut projects, Silhouette crafts, T-shirt designs, tote bags, stickers, mugs, sublimation, invitations, signs, labels, greeting cards, party decorations, and other DIY projects.\nFont Features:\n• Cute bold bubble lettering\n• Playful rounded characters\n• Uppercase and lowercase alphabet\n• Numbers 0–9\n• Basic punctuation and symbols\n• Basic Latin Unicode\n• Great for Cricut and Silhouette projects\n• Suitable for personal and commercial design projects",
